# Hand-written from the source; judgements in jsonpickle.md.
#
# Roles used below (jsonpickle.md, "Value sites"):
#   handlers: the registry holds handler classes and instances; every
#     package subclass of BaseHandler fits the role (judgement J4).
#   backends: simplejson, json, ujson and yaml (the package's own loads);
#     ujson, yaml and gmpy2 are not installed and are named as missing modules.
#   objects to pickle and decoded classes are client values (B5), except the
#     CloneFactory that the pickler makes for a defaultdict (judgement J6) and
#     the library values that the package itself forwards to the generic
#     pickler (judgement J11; the outside callees at the sites of
#     jsonpickle.md, "Open receiver sets", are a lower bound).
